     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Blossam Brook brings the outdoors into the play structure. Palm tree towers rise over slides and a net bridge, and a curved activity trail winds along one side for children to follow on foot. Along that trail they balance, hop and crawl, then climb the towers and slide down. Blossam Brook is meant for ages 3 to 12. The product area is 34'9\" x 25'3\" and the safe play area is 39'9\" x 31'3\", so it needs a generous lawn in a park, school or township. Blossam Brook is offered in Play Red, Play Orange or Knight Blue, and capacity is listed as 15 children. Its galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope have a 3-year warranty. Ask us how the trail can line up with your existing paths."
     }
    ]
   }
